Ini…

01:08:25.292 --> 01:08:26.792
Inilah kemampuan kami.

01:08:28.083 --> 01:08:29.250
Kau mati.

01:08:30.417 --> 01:08:31.458
Kau mati.

01:08:32.917 --> 01:08:34.333
Hei!

01:08:36.750 --> 01:08:37.708
Kau tamat!

01:08:41.792 --> 01:08:42.917
Kau tamat.

01:08:56.250 --> 01:08:57.417
Hei!

