Wah, gila.

01:18:21.458 --> 01:18:22.542
Notre Dame.

01:18:24.625 --> 01:18:25.458
George Murphy?

01:18:29.333 --> 01:18:30.625
John McLaughry.

01:18:33.000 --> 01:18:33.917
Brown?

01:18:34.000 --> 01:18:34.917
Aku orangnya.

01:18:35.542 --> 01:18:36.417
Sial.

01:18:37.583 --> 01:18:39.167
Banyak dari kita di sini.

01:18:39.250 --> 01:18:40.833
George Murphy.

01:18:40.917 --> 01:18:43.292
Bob Bauman. Wisconsin.

01:18:43.375 --> 01:18:45.583
Aku ingat kau, Bob. Senang bertemu.

01:18:45.667 --> 01:18:48.458
- Kita seri.
- Benar. Sebagian strategi memihak kalian.

01:18:48.542 --> 01:18:51.750
