- Ya, begitu kabarnya.
- Halaman belakang Jepang.

01:19:29.542 --> 01:19:31.583
Mereka akan sulit disingkirkan.

01:19:34.333 --> 01:19:36.375
Terpujilah Tuhan.

01:19:36.458 --> 01:19:37.583
Kekuatan-Ku,

01:19:37.667 --> 01:19:41.792
